Z||000000||Haze_Performance||06-04-2000||12:31 PM||||I just did a complete tune up a few weeks ago, and now on the way home last night one of the #@$!&  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"> plug wires laid on the exhaust manifold and burned up.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">  Anyone ever think of using plug wire wrap? I think im going to buy a roll from JEG"S or Summit.||||reg||8
